<title>POLAND: SLASKI FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 18.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>SLASKI FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 18.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit				    18.23 vs  29.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				27.62 vs  41.41</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	    71.85 vs  70.28</p>
<p>Interest and other related revenues  115.78 vs 113.08</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit				    36.80 vs  76.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				64.49 vs 100.24</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	   154.11 vs 141.22</p>
<p>Interest and other related revenues  233.13 vs 227.33</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
